[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2525366085","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100156#issuecomment-2525366085","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100156","id":2525366085,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6WhgdF","user":{"login":"passivestar","id":60579014,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNTc5MDE0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60579014?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar","html_url":"https://github.com/passivestar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-08T01:05:07Z","updated_at":"2024-12-08T01:05:07Z","body":"Works on my end, thanks","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2525366085/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2532269007","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100156#issuecomment-2532269007","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100156","id":2532269007,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6W71vP","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-10T16:49:36Z","updated_at":"2024-12-10T16:50:09Z","body":"> Same fix as #90035 but for a different code path.\r\n\r\nSeems like this was changed further in #96449.\r\n\r\nIt's starting to look like a game of whac-a-mole....\r\n\r\nCC @Maran23 @KoBeWi @kitbdev ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2532269007/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2532325920","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100156#issuecomment-2532325920","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100156","id":2532325920,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6W8Dog","user":{"login":"Maran23","id":66004280,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MDA0Mjgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66004280?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23","html_url":"https://github.com/Maran23","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-10T17:14:57Z","updated_at":"2024-12-10T17:21:16Z","body":"> Seems like this was changed further in #96449.\r\n> \r\n> It's starting to look like a game of whac-a-mole....\r\n> \r\n> CC @Maran23 @KoBeWi @kitbdev\r\n\r\nI think the problem is in the `RTL` control, as when it finished, I expect that the scrolling will always work. But it does not.\r\n\r\nWhy it happens sometimes for the `RTL` control is not clear, I also start to wonder if this might be related to the refresh rate of the screen as suggested in the issue. I have a 240 Hz screen and never got this issue after my fix again. \r\n\r\nMy fix removed code that was calling the whole help logic twice, so it fixed a problem, but the scrolling is still not stable (enough). For now, I wonder if simply calling `call_deferred()` is enough here, doing the scrolling at the end of the frame.\r\n\r\nEDIT: What is weird is that the `finished` signal is called, then the `vscroll` might get hidden, then `queue_redraw` is called. I wonder, if we rather want to emit the `finished` signal after the redraw instead (Or at least after `_validate_line_caches` is called, which seems to be done right after).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2532325920/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2532347998","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100156#issuecomment-2532347998","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100156","id":2532347998,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6W8JBe","user":{"login":"passivestar","id":60579014,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNTc5MDE0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60579014?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar","html_url":"https://github.com/passivestar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-10T17:25:11Z","updated_at":"2024-12-10T17:25:11Z","body":"> I also start to wonder if this might be related to the refresh rate of the screen as suggested in the issue. I have a 240 Hz screen and never got this issue after my fix again\r\n\r\nI use a 120hz one. I get it every time I use search in dev6","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2532347998/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2532457941","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100156#issuecomment-2532457941","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100156","id":2532457941,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6W8j3V","user":{"login":"ydeltastar","id":133662278,"node_id":"U_kgDOB_eGRg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/133662278?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar","html_url":"https://github.com/ydeltastar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-10T17:51:46Z","updated_at":"2024-12-10T18:18:56Z","body":"> Seems like this was changed further in #96449.\r\n\r\nFrom what I debugged, https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/90035 didn't fix the issue because the offsets were already calculated in that code path. Having it or reverting it didn't have any effect. I think it is good to have it connected to `draw` too as a guarantee anyway.\r\n\r\nThis PR affects another code path when the documentation is loaded and processed for the first time. When `scroll_to_paragraph` is called, the offsets aren't calculated yet.\r\n\r\n> My fix removed code that was calling the whole help logic twice, so it fixed a problem, but the scrolling is still not stable (enough). For now, I wonder if simply calling `call_deferred()` is enough here, doing the scrolling at the end of the frame.\r\n> \r\n> EDIT: What is weird is that the `finished` signal is called, then the `vscroll` might get hidden, then `queue_redraw` is called. I wonder, if we rather want to emit the `finished` signal after the redraw instead (Or at least after `_validate_line_caches` is called, which seems to be done right after).\r\n\r\nYes, the main issue is that `RichTextLabel.finished` can be emitted before the offsets are calculated in `_validate_line_caches` which happens in `NOTIFICATION_DRAW`.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/a372214a4a047ccf63d23c4406337b30e55ff60b/scene/gui/rich_text_label.cpp#L1899-L1902\r\n\r\nI think it makes sense since these calculations are dependent on theme changes and only relevant when drawing. So connecting to the `draw` signal which happens after `NOTIFICATION_DRAW` sounds like the best fix here.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2532457941/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2532468258","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100156#issuecomment-2532468258","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100156","id":2532468258,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6W8mYi","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-10T17:57:10Z","updated_at":"2024-12-10T17:57:10Z","body":"Note that AFAIK, the RichTextLabel for the editor help updates on a thread, so there might be race conditions. CC @bruvzg","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2532468258/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2532555320","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100156#issuecomment-2532555320","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100156","id":2532555320,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6W87o4","user":{"login":"Maran23","id":66004280,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MDA0Mjgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66004280?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23","html_url":"https://github.com/Maran23","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-10T18:21:22Z","updated_at":"2024-12-10T18:21:22Z","body":"@passivestar Does `CTRL+Left Click` works for you?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2532555320/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2532573287","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100156#issuecomment-2532573287","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100156","id":2532573287,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6W9ABn","user":{"login":"passivestar","id":60579014,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNTc5MDE0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60579014?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar","html_url":"https://github.com/passivestar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-10T18:30:44Z","updated_at":"2024-12-10T18:30:44Z","body":"> @passivestar Does CTRL+Left Click works for you?\r\n\r\nyeah it does","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2532573287/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2565600673","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100156#issuecomment-2565600673","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100156","id":2565600673,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Y6_Wh","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-30T15:08:20Z","updated_at":"2024-12-30T15:08:20Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2565600673/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]